# Babel Feed User Profile

## User Experience
- When user first opens the app, the app create a guest profile that's saved on device. 
- There is a profile page user could choose to open. There it shows user login status and profile settings.
- User could choose to bind their guest account to an email address by verifying that address. 
- Upon requesting verification, it creates an account in the backend service
- Upon successful verification, it updates the account to verified in the backend
- Once a user is verified, all requests they make from the app will include authentication header
- Due to the nature of this app (news feed), we don't want to actively authenticate users frequently. Once they have passed authentication their session on the app should stay indefinitely.